<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>A Sincere Apology</title>

<style>
* {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
    min-height: 100vh;
    background: #080808;
    color: #fff;
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    overflow-x: hidden;
    padding: 25px;
}

.background {
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    background:
        radial-gradient(
            circle at 50% 30%,
            rgba(139, 35, 65, 0.18),
            transparent 60%
        );
    z-index: -1;
}

.card {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 500px;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 40px 25px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
    border-radius: 22px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.025);
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    box-shadow: 0 0 60px rgba(130,20,50,0.08);
    animation: appear 1.5s ease;
}

.heart {
    font-size: 45px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    animation: pulse 2s infinite;
}

.label {
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 5px;
    color: #d69aa8;
    margin-bottom: 22px;
}

h1 {
    font-size: clamp(32px, 8vw, 46px);
    font-weight: normal;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
}

h1 span {
    color: #d69aa8;
    font-style: italic;
}

.subtitle {
    color: #aaa;
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
}

button {
    padding: 15px 27px;
    background: #d69aa8;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 30px;
    color: #171013;
    font-size: 14px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: 0.3s;
}

button:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(214,154,168,0.3);
}

#letter {
    display: none;
    text-align: left;
    margin-top: 30px;
    line-height: 1.9;
    color: #d0d0d0;
    font-size: 16px;
    animation: appear 1s ease;
}

#letter p {
    margin-bottom: 17px;
}

.signature {
    color: #d69aa8;
    font-style: italic;
    margin-top: 25px;
}

.footer {
    margin-top: 35px;
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    color: #666;
}

@keyframes appear {
    from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(20px);
    }
    to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
    }
}

@keyframes pulse {
    0%, 100% {
        transform: scale(1);
    }
    50% {
        transform: scale(1.12);
    }
}

.particle {
    position: fixed;
    bottom: -20px;
    color: #d69aa8;
    opacity: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    animation: floatUp linear infinite;
    z-index: -1;
}

@keyframes floatUp {
    0% {
        transform: translateY(0) rotate(0deg);
        opacity: 0;
    }
    20% {
        opacity: 0.5;
    }
    100% {
        transform: translateY(-110vh) rotate(180deg);
        opacity: 0;
    }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="background"></div>

<main class="card">

    <div class="heart">♡</div>

    <div class="label">A MESSAGE FROM THE HEART</div>

    <h1>I'm truly <span>sorry.</span></h1>

    <p class="subtitle">
        Sometimes, words cannot fix everything,
        but a sincere apology is a place to start.
    </p>

    <button id="openBtn" onclick="openLetter()">
        Read My Message ♡
    </button>

    <div id="letter">

        <p>Hey,</p>

        <p>
            I've been thinking about what happened,
            and I want to sincerely apologize.
            I know that my words or actions may have
            hurt you, and I'm truly sorry for that.
        </p>

        <p>
            I never wanted to make things difficult
            between us. I understand that saying
            "I'm sorry" doesn't automatically make
            everything okay.
        </p>

        <p>
            I'm not asking you to forget what happened
            or to forgive me immediately. I just want
            you to know that I recognize my mistake
            and that I want to learn from it.
        </p>

        <p>
            You deserve honesty, respect, and
            understanding. I hope that, with time,
            my actions can show you how sincere
            these words really are.
        </p>

        <p>
            Whatever you decide, I'll respect your
            feelings and your space.
        </p>

        <p>
            Thank you for taking the time to read this.
        </p>

        <p class="signature">
            With sincere apologies. ♡
        </p>

    </div>

    <div class="footer">
        WRITTEN WITH SINCERITY
    </div>

</main>

<script>
function openLetter() {
    const letter = document.getElementById("letter");
    const button = document.getElementById("openBtn");

    letter.style.display = "block";
    button.style.display = "none";

    letter.scrollIntoView({
        behavior: "smooth",
        block: "nearest"
    });
}

for (let i = 0; i < 15; i++) {
    const particle = document.createElement("div");

    particle.className = "particle";
    particle.textContent = "♡";

    particle.style.left = Math.random() * 100 + "vw";
    particle.style.animationDuration =
        (8 + Math.random() * 12) + "s";

    particle.style.animationDelay =
        (Math.random() * 10) + "s";

    particle.style.fontSize =
        (12 + Math.random() * 15) + "px";

    document.body.appendChild(particle);
}
</script>

</body>
</html>
